                                "sense_id": "12140bb9-fac5-3e0b-84ff-6019260a1fe8",
                                "text": "[The slave] toils that another may reap the fruit; he is industrious that another may live in idleness; he eats unbolted meal that another may eat the bread of fine flour; he labors in chains at home, under a burning sun and biting lash, that another may ride in ease and splendor abroad […]"
